From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rodrigo Goya <rodrigo.goya@abcellera.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 07:59:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] stamp: use full prototypes for C23 (GCC 15)

GCC 15 defaults to C23, where an empty parameter list declares a
function taking no arguments. Several stamp sources relied on
old-style declarations and no longer compile:

- qkfit.c: drop the f2c-style 'double sqrt(), d_sign(), atan(), cos()'
  redeclarations in favour of <math.h> (d_sign is unused), and declare
  eigen_/esort_ with their parameter types.
- matinv.c: drop block-scope 'vector()'/'free_vector()' redeclarations
  that shadow the full file-scope prototypes.
- swstruc.c: drop the 'FILE *fopen()' redeclaration; stdio.h declares it.
- dosort.c: make the qsort comparator take 'const void *' arguments.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 vmd/plugins/stamp/src/dosort.c  |  8 ++++----
 vmd/plugins/stamp/src/matinv.c  |  3 +--
 vmd/plugins/stamp/src/qkfit.c   | 11 +++--------
 vmd/plugins/stamp/src/swstruc.c |  2 +-
 4 files changed, 9 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

diff --git a/vmd/plugins/stamp/src/dosort.c b/vmd/plugins/stamp/src/dosort.c
index b2fc97d..180746f 100644
--- a/vmd/plugins/stamp/src/dosort.c
+++ b/vmd/plugins/stamp/src/dosort.c
@@ -33,7 +33,7 @@
 *****************************************************************************/
 #include <stamp.h>
 
-int comp();
+int comp(const void *left, const void *right);
 
 /*************************************************************************
 dosort:  Version 2:  create the sortarr array, then copy the values
@@ -91,8 +91,8 @@ struct path *dosort(struct olist *result, int *lena, int *total) {
 /*************************************************************************
 comp:  compare two scores in the sortarr array
 -------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
-int comp(left,right)
-     struct path *left, *right;
+int comp(const void *left, const void *right)
 {
-  return right->score - left->score;
+  const struct path *l = left, *r = right;
+  return r->score - l->score;
 }
diff --git a/vmd/plugins/stamp/src/matinv.c b/vmd/plugins/stamp/src/matinv.c
index acfc64e..13973be 100644
--- a/vmd/plugins/stamp/src/matinv.c
+++ b/vmd/plugins/stamp/src/matinv.c
@@ -106,8 +106,7 @@ int ludcmp(float **a, int n, int *indx, float *d)
 {
 	int i,imax=0,j,k;
 	float big,dum,sum,temp;
-	float *vv,*vector();
-	void free_vector();
+	float *vv;
 
 	vv=vector(1,n);
 	*d=1.0;
